# The image ships ONLY the serving engine + its requirements.
# db/ ships IN the image (449K): the scheduled ecb-rates-refresh Cloud Run job runs
# db.sync.sources.ecb.sync + db.sync.build_exchange_rate from the same immutable engine
# image. The compose "seed" service still bind-mounts ./db for local development.
# so seed-script changes never invalidate the image.
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.example
.env.*
!.env.example
.venv
.venv*
venv
.idea
.vscode
.terraform
**/.terraform
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
service-account*.json
*credentials*.json
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
engine/data/*.previous
.github
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
cloudbuild.yaml
docs
infra
tests
training
web
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
